    {
      "name": "settle",
      "docs": [
        "Ends a fill: the output vault must have gained at least `min_out`",
        "since the take. Everything in it goes to the owner's account and the",
        "order closes. Anyone can call it; the keeper does, in the take's",
        "transaction."
      ],
